    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Miya &amp; Aya: Hentai Puzzle 18+&quot;</i> is a captivating puzzle game where players assemble images of adorable catgirls by rotating and combining puzzle pieces. Once a level is completed, the collected images are added to the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of two catgirls\u2014Miya Nekohara and Ayako &quot;Aya&quot; Tsukimiya\u2014who meet through ancient magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479630/extras/b38c99242bd3fb7e0b9c3dd9ebe63a1b.avif?t=1747680009\" data-has-big width=800 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay revolves around progressing through levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, the heroines appear in cute outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, more revealing outfits are unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls interact with players, accompanying the game with their voices and sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the gallery, you can activate additional effects and enjoy the collected images.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn character art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character voice acting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities<strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash:</strong> Removes several unsolved puzzle pieces. Automatically regenerates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Splash:</strong> Removes many puzzle pieces. Charges during gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlight:</strong> Highlights unsolved pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling Stars:</strong> Periodically completes missing pieces by dropping stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow Trace:</strong> Occasionally flips pieces alongside yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery:</strong> Allows players to view collected artwork and activate sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Miya Nekohara</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479630/extras/aba6ff36f864969d04151006ab001a61.avif?t=1747680009\" data-has-big width=800 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race:</strong> Half-kitten, half-human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance:</strong> Miya is petite and graceful, with short black ears, a fluffy tail, and large golden eyes. Her long black hair has a blue sheen. On weekdays, she wears a school uniform with a short skirt, while on weekends, she prefers cozy sweaters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Quiet, shy, and caring. Loves warm milk, knitting, and quiet evenings. Sometimes, her feline instincts take over, which embarrasses her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Traits:</strong> Miya has excellent hearing and can sense danger. When nervous, she fidgets with her tail or meows.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ayako &quot;Aya&quot; Tsukimiya</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479630/extras/edba15b683aa49ff9e986779caf2604d.avif?t=1747680009\" data-has-big width=800 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race:</strong> Catgirl from the ancient &quot;Moon Guardians&quot; clan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appearance:</strong> Tall and athletic, with short ears and a fluffy tail. Aya prefers a sporty style: bomber jackets, sneakers, and short shorts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Spirited, energetic, and bold. A natural protector, she's willing to take risks for her loved ones. Despite this, she dreams of a peaceful life far from clan duties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Traits:</strong> Aya is a master climber and has excellent night vision. Her agility and speed often save her in dangerous situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience stunning solo and duo artwork that reveals the personalities and stories of these charming heroines!</p>",
